            <p style="color:#d1d5db;margin-top:16px;">Discounts are the monthly plan rates: Basic 82%, Pro 73%, Ultra 63%, applied per line and rounded, and every column sums to its own total. The line to show the merchandising lead is the localization one. Those 72 marketplace overlay edits cost <strong style="color:#f9fafb;">432 credits</strong> because they are flat-6 image edits — but the identical content produced the lazy way, as fresh 24-credit Pro generations per language, would be <strong style="color:#f9fafb;">1,728</strong>, and would invalidate the approved product pixels every time. Localization is 12% of the invoice as edits and would be 48% of it as re-generations. That single behavioral choice — edit the approved image vs. re-roll it — is worth more than any model swap on this sheet.</p>
