            <p style="color:#d1d5db;margin-top:16px;">Discounts are the monthly plan rates: Basic 82%, Pro 73%, Ultra 63%, applied per line and rounded, and the columns sum to the total. Read as a P&amp;L instead of a bill: stills and edits are 1,584 (40%), motion is 1,548 (39%), the audio layer is 820 (21%). The two buffer lines — canary pool and bed library, 340 combined — are the only ones that do not belong to a client, and they are the cheapest insurance on the sheet: they buy the right to be wrong sixty times and to never regenerate a piece of music twice. Every other line is client-attributable at <strong style="color:#f9fafb;">602 list per account</strong> — which is the number that has to fit inside a retainer, before labor.</p>
